* Example library: a generic op-amp and two discrete parts
*
* connections:    non-inverting input
*                 | inverting input
*                 | | positive supply
*                 | | | negative supply
*                 | | | | output
*                 | | | | |
.subckt GENERIC_OPAMP INP INN VP VN OUT PARAMS: GAIN=100k RO=75
RIN INP INN 1Meg
G1 0 INT INP INN {GAIN/1Meg}
RP INT 0 1Meg
CP INT 0 15.9p
DHIGH INT VP DCLAMP
DLOW VN INT DCLAMP
E2 DRIVE 0 INT 0 1
ROUT DRIVE OUT {RO}
.model DCLAMP D(IS=1e-15)
.ends GENERIC_OPAMP

.model 1N4148 D(IS=2.52n RS=0.568 N=1.752 CJO=4p M=0.4 TT=20n BV=100 IBV=100u)
.model 2N3904 NPN(IS=6.734f BF=416.4 VAF=74.03 IKF=66.78m ISE=6.734f NE=1.259 BR=0.7371 CJE=4.493p CJC=3.638p TF=301.2p TR=239.5n)
